      "updated": 1787440041718,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7) Scale: p95 under ~200ms\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7) Scale: p95 under ~200ms\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZpazKx_AAnKZQzQgfUb51",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1123.9275918428239,
      "y": 2551.0816376966295,
      "width": 1265.710368742817,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 763392451,
      "version": 81,
      "versionNonce": 1320986893,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787440059512,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Put an API gateway or edge layer in front to handle authentication, request shaping, pagination, and response caching (e.g.,\ncatalog metadata, rec rows) with careful TTLs and cache keys per profile/locale.\n- Collapse duplicate requests, apply rate limits, and use circuit breakers/timeouts to isolate slow downstreams; return partial\nresults when possible.\n- Precompute and materialize common views (e.g., home rows) so your API can fetch them with O(1) reads; ship lightweight\nmanifests to drive the client UI, deferring heavy detail fetches.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Put an API gateway or edge layer in front to handle authentication, request shaping, pagination, and response caching (e.g., catalog metadata, rec rows) with careful TTLs and cache keys per profile/locale.\n- Collapse duplicate requests, apply rate limits, and use circuit breakers/timeouts to isolate slow downstreams; return partial results when possible.\n- Precompute and materialize common views (e.g., home rows) so your API can fetch them with O(1) reads; ship lightweight manifests to drive the client UI, deferring heavy detail fetches.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
